            "502": "{ error: agent_failed }",
            "503": "{ error: missing_openai_key }"
          },
          "notes": "Next.js route in apps/web (not served by pnpm mock); mode=template is the offline stand-in. ask is whole currency units today (known gap vs integer minor units)."
